# Origin of the NesAfric web/API deployment the app talks to. Required — the app has no default.
# https:// only, except http://localhost / http://10.0.2.2 (Android emulator → host) for local dev.
# Production is https://www.nesafric.com — the canonical host. The bare https://nesafric.com answers
# every request with a 308 redirect to www, which native apps can't follow for sign-in (POST) and
# which strips the Authorization header on Android, so never use the bare domain here.
# The staging URL in the web repo's staging-jobs-cron workflow has NOT been verified as reachable;
# confirm any URL before using it.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
